  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CZ - GREEN INVESTMENT SCHEME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to purchase AAUs or &apos;emission allowances&apos; based on Article 17 of the Kyoto Protocol for the World Bank Carbon Funds and support reduction of CO2 emissions and air pollutants, increase the use of renewable energy, and improve energyefficiency in the residential sector of the Czech Republic.</narrative>
  </description>
